      "worked": "Since $l=r\\theta$, the sector area is $A=\\frac12r(r\\theta)=\\frac12rl$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}36\\pi&=\\frac12r(6\\pi)\\\\36\\pi&=3\\pi r\\\\r&=12\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe perimeter includes the arc and both radii.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=l+2r\\\\P&=6\\pi+2(12)\\\\P&=(24+6\\pi)\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
